  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 12-layer planar stack on Ge substrate with sequence ZnS, ZnSe, ZnS, ZnSe, ZnS, ZnSe, ZnS, ZnSe, ZnS, ZnSe, ZnS, ZnSe. Initialize all 12 layers with thicknesses [417.0, 455.0, 500.0, 696.0, 1000.0, 1000.0, 553.0, 510.0, 593.0, 501.0, 417.0, 455.0] nm. Fix layers 0, 1, 2, 9, 10, 11 to these initial values. Optimize layers 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8 using gradient-based methods with bounds set to ±7% of their initial values. Evaluate transmittance in 8000-11000 nm (maximize) and 3000-5000 nm (minimize) at normal incidence. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 8000-11000 nm, 3000-5000 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 8000-11000 nm band; Low transmittance in 3000-5000 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: High transmittance in 3000-5000 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Total layer count not exceeding 16.",
